			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Prevent the PRASS from tier skipping by @Zorbatron in https://github.com/Zorbatron/ZBGT/pull/155\n* Make generic circuits craft 1 at a time instead of 16 by @Zorbatron in https://github.com/Zorbatron/ZBGT/pull/157\n* Port many items and casing blocks from GT++ and the Molecular Transformer by @Zorbatron in https://github.com/Zorbatron/ZBGT/pull/152\n* Cal fixes by @Zorbatron in https://github.com/Zorbatron/ZBGT/pull/160\n* Lower the casing minimum on the volcanus from 8 to 6 by @Zorbatron in https://github.com/Zorbatron/ZBGT/pull/161\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Zorbatron/ZBGT/compare/v0.16.1...v0.16.2"
